    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "克莱恩属于我们的控制区域。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.cryon-sector-1.01.02",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 5.795
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "这是最后一次警告。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.cryon-sector-1.02.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 5.795
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "任何试图进入克莱恩的 Sharded 单位，都将被视为入侵者。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.cryon-sector-1.02.02",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 7.727
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "不要试探我们的底线。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.cryon-sector-1.03.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 5.628
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "我们已经做好了应对准备。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.cryon-sector-1.03.02",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 5.67
    }
  ]
